5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we say yes. No surprises!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I am tired of losing days to travel. Let us look at the time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a clear rule on who pays for what. No ambiguity.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to know about the bathroom and the food times.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand why we felt alone last time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if we pick the island, is the ferry fast?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
