12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, the bathroom situation is critical for your sleep.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, yes. And where I can sit without a bed.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, knowing the price helps me decide if it is worth it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the house prices and the ferry times.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the ferry and the train times to compare.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the all-in rates and the separate room costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the bathing hours and the inn mealtimes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look at the time alone and how last year ran.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay, let us see what we find. I hope it is cheap!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let us be efficient. I do not want to waste time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Clarity is the only way to avoid conflict.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I just want a good week. Let us see the details.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will wait for the information. It will guide my choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
