35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island house is 5,400 yen a head a night! That is great!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Renting a whole house means one bill. No one is out of pocket.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island has one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Last year we were apart. A shared house means no private space.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, two days is too long. I want to play, not travel.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train is faster. But the city has no shared space.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, one bathroom is a problem. But the cost is fair.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I can handle it. But the cold water is bad.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, if we go to the city, we might not see each other.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I like the island price. But the travel time is scary.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The spa town is a good middle ground. Fast train, good food.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The spa town has all-in rates. That is fair for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The spa town has fixed meal times. I might like that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The spa town has streets. I can have time alone there.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am leaning towards the spa town. It is fast and fair.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I agree. The train is efficient. I do not mind the inn.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The all-in rate solves the payment issue. I support it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,The fixed times are okay. I can sleep well if the bath is good.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The spa town offers balance. I will vote for it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
